		// StateUnknown: Vacant
		// UnknownName: (blank)
		// UnknownHint: A blank on the register. The night is long — a name will walk up here on its own
		// SealedOriginHint: The seal holds. Do not lift it, do not answer it, do not look back
		// SealedPowerHint: ———
		// UnrenewedOriginHint: The old pact knows the blade, not this hand. Go to where it was first subdued, and renew the name
		// UnrenewedPowerHint: ———
		// CloseTagText: ROLL
		// CloseHintFormat: ESC · {0} · click outside to roll up
